@startuml
title 流式 LLM 语义解析链
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "plaintext payload ingress" as Ingress
component "connection / stream state" as Router
component "HTTP/1 或 HTTP/2 解码" as Http
component "SSE / JSON 响应解析" as Body
component "provider codec" as Provider
component "request / response 关联与投影" as Projection
database "actions / links / evidence" as Storage

Ingress -down-> Router : payload、gap、close
Router -down-> Http : 按连接和方向推进
Http -down-> Body : decoded body + HTTP context
Body -down-> Provider : 完整事件或完整 JSON
Provider -down-> Projection : provider-neutral update
Projection -down-> Storage : llm.request / response / call
Router -right-> Projection : trace / stream 生命周期
Projection -down-> Storage : partial action 或 compact diagnostic
@enduml
